SUMMARY

cron2, dazo, mattock and ordex participated in this meeting.

--

Discussed making pkcs11-helper URI-compliant with RFC7512:

<https://github.com/OpenVPN/openvpn-build/pull/110>
<https://github.com/OpenSC/pkcs11-helper/pull/4>

Earlier discussion on openvpn-devel:

<https://www.mail-archive.com/openvpn-devel@lists.sourceforge.net/msg00156.=
html>

It was agreed that bundling the patch with future 2.4-based Windows
installers makes sense, and that the potential for breakage is small.
Dazo can cron2 approved the approach, and mattock will merge the PR.

